# Nougat extraction stub

**Status:** Not re-run for this replication.

**Reason:** The target paper (Cogno, Bauer, Durante, *Commun Med* 4:16, 2024, DOI 10.1038/s43856-024-00442-w) is Nature open-access HTML. The replication team cited the HTML text directly and parsed the referenced Zenodo `Code.zip` (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.10185637) for parameter values. No PDF-to-Markdown re-conversion was needed for the replication narrative captured in `REPORT.md`.

**If a downstream consumer needs a Nougat MMD dump:**

1. Fetch the PDF from https://www.nature.com/articles/s43856-024-00442-w.pdf (OA).
2. Run: `nougat --model 0.1.0-base --markdown --out extraction/ paper.pdf`
3. Expect: `extraction/paper.mmd` — full paper body in Markdown with equations preserved via `$...$` inline / `$$...$$` display.

**Alternative extraction targets referenced in this replication:**

- Equations 2–4 (ΔECM sigmoid, RSI, LQ-CV FSU survival) — see `report/REPORT.tex` for the LaTeX-rendered forms.
- Parameter values (α, α/β, thresholds, rates, cell counts) — see `code/Code.zip:code/ABM model/src/sim-param.h` in the Zenodo deposit.
- Fig 5 / 6 / 7 reproduction targets — see `figures/fig{5,6,7}_like.png` for our surrogate's outputs.

**Backfill date:** 2026-07-06.
